          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Is the script keeping up?**\nIf the Collector Lag is high, it means your network is generating logs faster than the Python script can read them. If the Alert Queue is full, the AI is overwhelmed."
